error[E0571]: field 'r' has type '&int32', which a record cannot hold
 --> $DIR/field-reference.nra:2:20
  |
2 | let P = record (r: &int);
  |                    ^^^^ '&int32' is a reference, which is not a value
  |
  = help: hold a record, a tuple or an enum of eligible types, or declare 'P' as an #Immutable class and not as a record

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0571`.
